      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Trigger Hallod scores a critical hit with a melee attack.\n\n---\n\nEffect Hallod can attempt an Athletics check to Shove or Trip the target of his attack. This uses the same multiple attack penalty as the attack, but it does not count as an additional attack for that penalty",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "note",
          "selector": "melee-strike-damage",
          "text": "{item|name} F\nTrigger Hallod scores a critical hit with a melee attack.\nEffect Hallod can attempt an Athletics check to Shove or Trip the target of his attack. This uses the same multiple attack penalty as the attack, but it does not count as an additional attack for that penalty",
          "outcome": [
            "criticalSuccess"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "One-Two Move",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Hallod makes two Strikes, one with each hand; he usually attacks first with his kukri. If this first attack hits, the target is Off-Guard to the second attack (which for Hallod is usually a fist Strike). The multiple attack penalty applies to these attacks as normal"
    },
    {
